#: src/Modules/ProductDesigner/Admin/CampaignsPage.php:148
msgid "The company's own campaigns for designer products. Outside a campaign the company always keeps the base price: a discount comes off the creator's profit, never below 0. In a campaign the discount is shared between the company and the creator in proportion to base price and profit. An order line is in a campaign when the campaign ran when it was bought and the order used one of the campaign's coupon codes, or the campaign covers sale prices and the line was sold below its price. Legacy products are never affected."
msgstr "Virksomhedens egne kampagner for designer-produkter. Uden for en kampagne får virksomheden altid grundprisen: en rabat tages fra creatorens fortjeneste, aldrig under 0. I en kampagne deles rabatten mellem virksomheden og creatoren i forholdet grundpris til fortjeneste. En ordrelinje er i en kampagne, når kampagnen kørte, da linjen blev købt, og ordren brugte en af kampagnens kuponkoder, eller kampagnen omfatter tilbudspriser, og linjen blev solgt under sin pris. Legacy-produkter berøres aldrig."

