#: src/Modules/ProductDesigner/Admin/DesignerSettingsSection.php:127
msgid "A private token from the Printful Developer Portal with as few scopes as possible (the catalog and the mockup generator need no store access). It is stored encrypted and never shown again; leave the field empty to keep the stored one."
msgstr "En privat token fra Printfuls Developer Portal med så få scopes som muligt (kataloget og mockup-generatoren kræver ikke adgang til butikken). Den gemmes krypteret og vises aldrig igen; lad feltet stå tomt for at beholde den gemte."

