#: src/Modules/ProductDesigner/Admin/DesignerSettingsSection.php:132
msgid "Create an account at printful.com and a store of the type \"Manual order platform / API\" that is not connected to a web shop, so nothing is published or sold through Printful."
msgstr "Opret en konto på printful.com og en butik af typen \"Manual order platform / API\", der ikke er koblet til en webshop, så intet publiceres eller sælges via Printful."

#: src/Modules/ProductDesigner/Admin/DesignerSettingsSection.php:133
msgid "In Printful's Developer Portal (developers.printful.com), create a private token with access to that one store and as few scopes as possible. Do not choose orders, sync products or webhooks: Merch Dashboard never creates orders or products at Printful."
msgstr "Opret i Printfuls Developer Portal (developers.printful.com) en privat token med adgang til den ene butik og så få scopes som muligt. Vælg ikke orders, sync products eller webhooks: Merch Dashboard opretter aldrig ordrer eller produkter hos Printful."

#: src/Modules/ProductDesigner/Admin/DesignerSettingsSection.php:134
msgid "Paste the token above, switch Printful on and save."
