msgid "%1$s (mapped to %2$s)"
msgstr "%1$s (mappet til %2$s)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:340
msgid "The preview shows what the mapping would do. Nothing is changed until you confirm. The default product category cannot be mapped, and a category can only belong to one creator."
msgstr "Forhåndsvisningen viser, hvad mappingen vil gøre. Intet ændres, før du bekræfter. Standardproduktkategorien kan ikke mappes, og en kategori kan kun tilhøre én creator."

#. translators: %s: category name.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:354
#, php-format
msgid "Remove the mapping of \"%s\""
msgstr "Fjern mappingen af \"%s\""

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:364
msgid "Choose what happens to the links this mapping created. Manual links are never changed. Nothing is changed until you confirm."
msgstr "Vælg, hvad der skal ske med de tilknytninger, denne mapping har oprettet. Manuelle tilknytninger ændres aldrig. Intet ændres, før du bekræfter."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:366
msgid "Preview: remove category-managed links"
msgstr "Forhåndsvisning: fjern kategoristyrede tilknytninger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:367
msgid "Includes products that have left the category but still hold a category link to this creator."
msgstr "Omfatter produkter, der har forladt kategorien, men stadig har en kategoritilknytning til denne creator."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:370
msgid "Preview: keep as manual links"
msgstr "Forhåndsvisning: behold som manuelle tilknytninger"

#. translators: %d: number of links.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:372
#, php-format
msgid "%d category-managed link becomes a manual link to this creator. It keeps the creator and is no longer changed by categories."
msgid_plural "%d category-managed links become manual links to this creator. They keep the creator and are no longer changed by categories."
msgstr[0] "%d kategoristyret tilknytning bliver en manuel tilknytning til denne creator. Den beholder creatoren og ændres ikke længere af kategorier."
msgstr[1] "%d kategoristyrede tilknytninger bliver manuelle tilknytninger til denne creator. De beholder creatoren og ændres ikke længere af kategorier."

#. translators: %d: most links converted per run.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:374
#, php-format
msgid "At most %d links are converted per run, and you need permission to edit each product. If links are left or fail, the mapping stays in place and you can run this again; links already converted are not converted twice."
msgstr "Højst %d tilknytninger konverteres pr. kørsel, og du skal have tilladelse til at redigere hvert produkt. Er der tilknytninger tilbage, eller fejler nogle, bevares mappingen, og du kan køre det igen; allerede konverterede tilknytninger konverteres ikke to gange."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:381
msgid "What happens to the category-managed links"
msgstr "Hvad der sker med de kategoristyrede tilknytninger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:385
msgid "I have reviewed the preview and want to remove the mapping with the chosen option."
msgstr "Jeg har gennemgået forhåndsvisningen og vil fjerne mappingen med det valgte."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:386
msgid "Remove mapping"
msgstr "Fjern mapping"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:407
msgid "This is a preview. Nothing has been changed."
msgstr "Dette er en forhåndsvisning. Intet er ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeActions.php:92
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to manage creator discount codes."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at administrere creator-rabatkoder."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:59
msgid "Discount code created. Its coupon gives the creator's profit on their own products as discount; it applies to orders created from now on."
msgstr "Rabatkoden er oprettet. Dens kupon giver creatorens fortjeneste på egne produkter som rabat; den gælder for ordrer oprettet fra nu af."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:60
msgid "New discount code created. The earlier code was ended and its coupon moved to the trash, so it no longer works; orders created before now keep their decision."
msgstr "Ny rabatkode er oprettet. Den tidligere kode er afsluttet, og dens kupon er flyttet til papirkurven, så den virker ikke længere; ordrer oprettet før nu beholder deres afgørelse."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:61
msgid "Discount code ended. Orders created from now on with this code count normally; earlier orders keep their decision."
msgstr "Rabatkoden er afsluttet. Ordrer, der oprettes med koden fra nu af, tæller normalt; tidligere ordrer beholder deres afgørelse."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:62
msgid "Nothing was changed: this code is already the creator's active code."
msgstr "Intet blev ændret: koden er allerede creatorens aktive kode."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:63
msgid "Not saved: enter a coupon code of at most 191 characters."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: indtast en kuponkode på højst 191 tegn."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:64
msgid "Not saved: there is no WooCommerce coupon with this code."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: der findes ingen WooCommerce-kupon med denne kode."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:65
msgid "Not saved: this is a gift card code, not a discount code."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: det er en gavekortkode, ikke en rabatkode."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:66
msgid "Not saved: it could not be checked whether this is a gift card code. Try again later."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: det kunne ikke kontrolleres, om det er en gavekortkode. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:67
msgid "No free code was found. Nothing was changed; try again."
msgstr "Der blev ikke fundet en ledig kode. Intet blev ændret; prøv igen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:68
msgid "The WooCommerce coupon could not be created. Nothing was changed; try again later."
msgstr "WooCommerce-kuponen kunne ikke oprettes. Intet blev ændret; prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:69
msgid "The earlier coupon could not be moved to the trash. Nothing was changed; try again later."
msgstr "Den tidligere kupon kunne ikke flyttes til papirkurven. Intet blev ændret; prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:70
msgid "The creator has no active discount code."
msgstr "Creatoren har ingen aktiv rabatkode."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:71
msgid "Another change of this code is in progress. Nothing was changed; try again."
msgstr "En anden ændring af koden er i gang. Intet blev ændret; prøv igen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:72
msgid "You are not allowed to manage creator discount codes."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at administrere creator-rabatkoder."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:74
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:104
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:106
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:84
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:202
msgid "A technical error occurred. Nothing was changed; try again later."
msgstr "Der opstod en teknisk fejl. Intet blev ændret; prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:86
msgid "The WooCommerce coupon with this code no longer exists."
msgstr "WooCommerce-kuponen med denne kode findes ikke længere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:87
msgid "The coupon's discount is not the creator's profit: it was registered by hand before Merch Dashboard managed the codes, or its discount type was changed in WooCommerce. Create a new discount code to fix it."
msgstr "Kuponens rabat er ikke creatorens fortjeneste: den blev registreret manuelt, før Merch Dashboard styrede koderne, eller dens rabattype er ændret i WooCommerce. Opret en ny rabatkode for at rette det."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:88
msgid "The code now belongs to another WooCommerce coupon than the registered one."
msgstr "Koden tilhører nu en anden WooCommerce-kupon end den registrerede."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:103
msgid "The creator's own WooCommerce coupon, which lets the creator buy their own merchandise without paying for their profit. Merch Dashboard creates it: its discount is exactly the creator's profit on each of their own products (the creator's or the product's own share), and nothing on other creators' products. It cannot be combined with other coupons. In an order that uses it, the creator's own products do not count in the creator's sales, profit or payouts, whoever placed the order. A code applies to orders created from its creation on; earlier orders are never changed. The creator can reset the code in the dashboard."
msgstr "Creatorens egen WooCommerce-kupon, så creatoren kan købe sit eget merchandise uden at betale for sin fortjeneste. Merch Dashboard opretter den: rabatten er præcis creatorens fortjeneste på hvert af creatorens egne produkter (creatorens eller produktets egen andel) og intet på andre creators' produkter. Den kan ikke kombineres med andre kuponer. I en ordre, der bruger den, tæller creatorens egne produkter ikke med i creatorens salg, fortjeneste eller udbetalinger, uanset hvem der har bestilt. En kode gælder for ordrer oprettet fra oprettelsen; tidligere ordrer ændres aldrig. Creatoren kan nulstille koden i dashboardet."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:118
msgid "The discount codes could not be read. Please try again later."
msgstr "Rabatkoderne kunne ikke læses. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:143
msgid "No active discount code."
msgstr "Ingen aktiv rabatkode."

#. translators: 1: discount code, 2: date.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:150
#, php-format
msgid "Active code: %1$s, since %2$s."
msgstr "Aktiv kode: %1$s, siden %2$s."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:153
msgid "Open the coupon in WooCommerce"
msgstr "Åbn kuponen i WooCommerce"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:165
msgid "Check the coupon:"
msgstr "Kontrollér kuponen:"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:165
msgid "Orders with the registered code are still excluded and are marked with a deviation. The registration is not ended automatically."
msgstr "Ordrer med den registrerede kode udelukkes fortsat og markeres med en afvigelse. Registreringen afsluttes ikke automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:172
msgid "End code"
msgstr "Afslut kode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:172
msgid "Orders created from then on with this code count normally."
msgstr "Ordrer, der derefter oprettes med koden, tæller normalt."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:187
msgid "Create discount code"
msgstr "Opret rabatkode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:187
msgid "Create new discount code"
msgstr "Opret ny rabatkode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCodeSection.php:188
msgid "Creates a code from the creator's name and a WooCommerce coupon for it."
