msgstr "Du har desværre ikke tilladelse til at administrere creator-priser."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:83
msgid "Creator markup saved. It applies to order lines created from now on; no WooCommerce price and no earlier order line was changed."
msgstr "Creatorens markup er gemt. Den gælder for ordrelinjer, der oprettes fremover; ingen WooCommerce-pris og ingen tidligere ordrelinje er ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:84
msgid "The creator markup was not changed."
msgstr "Creatorens markup blev ikke ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:85
msgid "VAT status registered; it is the current status. It applies to order lines created from now on; prices, earlier order lines, settlement documents and payouts are not changed."
msgstr "Momsstatus registreret; den er nu den gældende status. Den gælder for ordrelinjer, der oprettes fra nu af; priser, tidligere ordrelinjer, afregningsbilag og udbetalinger ændres ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:86
msgid "VAT status registered in the history. The current status is unchanged, because another registration applies today. Nothing earlier was changed."
msgstr "Momsstatus registreret i historikken. Den gældende status er uændret, fordi en anden registrering gælder i dag. Intet tidligere er ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:87
msgid "Nothing was registered: it is the same as the last registration."
msgstr "Intet blev registreret: det er det samme som den seneste registrering."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:88
msgid "Not saved: choose Yes or No."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: vælg Ja eller Nej."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:89
msgid "Not saved: enter the date the status applies from; it cannot be in the future."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: angiv datoen, status gælder fra; den må ikke ligge i fremtiden."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:90
msgid "Not saved: enter the date the status was checked; it cannot be in the future."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: angiv datoen, status blev kontrolleret; den må ikke ligge i fremtiden."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:91
msgid "Not saved: enter a documentation reference of at most 191 characters."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: angiv en dokumentationsreference på højst 191 tegn."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:92
msgid "Not saved: enter a reason of at most 500 characters."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: angiv en begrundelse på højst 500 tegn."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:93
msgid "Product markup saved. It applies to order lines created from now on; the WooCommerce price was not changed."
msgstr "Produktmarkup er gemt. Den gælder for ordrelinjer, der oprettes fremover; WooCommerce-prisen er ikke ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:94
msgid "The product markup was not changed."
msgstr "Produktmarkup blev ikke ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:95
msgid "Product markup removed: the creator markup applies again to order lines created from now on."
msgstr "Produktmarkup er fjernet: creatorens markup gælder igen for ordrelinjer, der oprettes fremover."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:96
msgid "The product has no product markup."
msgstr "Produktet har ingen produktmarkup."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:97
msgid "You are not allowed to change the pricing of this product."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at ændre prisen på dette produkt."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:98
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorProductsSection.php:102
msgid "The product does not exist."
msgstr "Produktet findes ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:100
msgid "Not saved: enter a markup between 0 and 100 with at most two decimals."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: angiv en markup mellem 0 og 100 med højst to decimaler."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:101
msgid "The product has no creator."
msgstr "Produktet har ingen creator."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:102
msgid "The product does not belong to this creator, so nothing was changed here."
msgstr "Produktet tilhører ikke denne creator, så intet blev ændret her."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:103
msgid "A product markup can only be set for a simple or variable product; variations use their parent's markup."
msgstr "En produktmarkup kan kun sættes for et simpelt eller variabelt produkt; varianter bruger hovedproduktets markup."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:119
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Priser"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:120
msgid "The WooCommerce sale price is the final customer price and already includes the creator profit and VAT. Creator profit = sale price × markup %. Merch Dashboard never adds anything to the price and never changes WooCommerce prices."
msgstr "WooCommerce-salgsprisen er den endelige kundepris og indeholder allerede creator-profit og moms. Creator-profit = salgspris × markup %. Merch Dashboard lægger aldrig noget oven i prisen og ændrer aldrig WooCommerce-priser."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:121
msgid "For each order line, the profit is calculated from the amount the customer actually paid including VAT, with the markup and VAT status that applied when the order line was created."
msgstr "For hver ordrelinje beregnes profitten ud fra det beløb, kunden faktisk betalte inkl. moms, med den markup og momsstatus, der gjaldt, da ordrelinjen blev oprettet."

#. translators: 1: product id, 2: outcome message.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:148
#, php-format
msgid "Product #%1$d: %2$s"
msgstr "Produkt #%1$d: %2$s"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:162
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PricingLabels.php:33
msgid "Creator markup"
msgstr "Creatorens markup"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:165
msgid "Creator share of the sale price (%)"
msgstr "Creatorens andel af salgsprisen (%)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:167
msgid "Save markup"
msgstr "Gem markup"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:168
msgid "0–100 %, at most two decimals. Example: a sale price of 100.00 at 20 % gives a creator profit of 20.00. It applies to products without their own product markup."
msgstr "0–100 %, højst to decimaler. Eksempel: en salgspris på 100,00 med 20 % giver en creator-profit på 20,00. Den gælder for produkter uden egen produktmarkup."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:187
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:192
