msgid "VAT registered"
msgstr "Momsregistreret"

#. translators: %s: Yes or No.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "Current VAT status: %s. New order lines get this status."
msgstr "Gældende momsstatus: %s. Nye ordrelinjer får denne status."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:195
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:233
msgid "Applies from"
msgstr "Gælder fra"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:196
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:233
msgid "Checked on"
msgstr "Kontrolleret"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:197
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:233
msgid "Documentation reference"
msgstr "Dokumentationsreference"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:199
msgid "Register VAT status"
msgstr "Registrér momsstatus"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:200
msgid "Yes: the creator is paid the full creator profit, including VAT."
msgstr "Ja: creatoren får hele creator-profitten udbetalt inkl. moms."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:201
msgid "No: the creator is paid the same share of the sale price excluding VAT; the VAT of the sale is not paid out."
msgstr "Nej: creatoren får samme andel af salgsprisen ekskl. moms udbetalt; salgets moms udbetales ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:202
msgid "Changing the VAT status changes no product prices and no earlier order lines or payouts: each order line keeps the status it had when it was created."
msgstr "Ændring af momsstatus ændrer ingen produktpriser og ingen tidligere ordrelinjer eller udbetalinger: hver ordrelinje beholder den status, den havde, da den blev oprettet."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:203
msgid "\"Applies from\" is the date the status applies from; \"Checked on\" is the date it was checked, for example in the CVR register. Neither may be in the future. Each registration is kept unchanged; to correct one, register again with a reason. A registration with an earlier date changes no order lines, settlement documents or payouts made before it."
msgstr "\"Gælder fra\" er datoen, status gælder fra; \"Kontrolleret\" er datoen, den blev kontrolleret, fx i CVR-registret. Ingen af dem må ligge i fremtiden. Hver registrering bevares uændret; ret en registrering ved at registrere igen med en begrundelse. En registrering med en tidligere dato ændrer ingen ordrelinjer, afregningsbilag eller udbetalinger, der er lavet før den."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:221
msgid "VAT status history"
msgstr "Historik over momsstatus"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:225
msgid "No VAT status has been registered in the history yet. The current status was set before the history was introduced; earlier changes are in the audit log."
msgstr "Der er endnu ikke registreret nogen momsstatus i historikken. Den gældende status blev sat, før historikken blev indført; tidligere ændringer står i audit-loggen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:246
msgid "Applies today"
msgstr "Gælder i dag"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:268
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PricingLabels.php:32
msgid "Product markup"
msgstr "Produktmarkup"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:271
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorProductsSection.php:177
msgid "No products are linked to this creator yet."
msgstr "Der er endnu ingen produkter tilknyttet denne creator."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:275
msgid "The examples use the current WooCommerce price as stored and the creator's current VAT status. Actual profit and payout are calculated per order line from the amount paid."
msgstr "Eksemplerne bruger den aktuelle WooCommerce-pris, som den er gemt, og creatorens nuværende momsstatus. Den faktiske profit og udbetaling beregnes pr. ordrelinje ud fra det betalte beløb."

