msgid "Replaces the creator markup for this product and all its variations. It does not change the WooCommerce price."
msgstr "Erstatter creatorens markup for dette produkt og alle dets varianter. WooCommerce-prisen ændres ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:394
msgid "Save product markup"
msgstr "Gem produktmarkup"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:399
msgid "A product markup set for a previous creator is ignored."
msgstr "En produktmarkup, der blev sat for en tidligere creator, ignoreres."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:404
