#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:62
msgid "Merch Dashboard Recalculations"
msgstr "Merch Dashboard Genberegninger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:63
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:127
msgid "Recalculations"
msgstr "Genberegninger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:87
msgid "The preview was created. Nothing was paid, offset or changed: review it, then approve or reject it."
msgstr "Forhåndsvisningen er oprettet. Intet er udbetalt, modregnet eller ændret: gennemgå den, og godkend eller afvis den derefter."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:88
msgid "The recalculation was approved. Nothing was executed yet: execute it as a separate step."
msgstr "Genberegningen er godkendt. Intet er udført endnu: udfør den som et særskilt trin."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:89
msgid "The recalculation was rejected. It stays in the history and is never reopened automatically."
msgstr "Genberegningen er afvist. Den bliver i historikken og genåbnes aldrig automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:90
msgid "A new preview was created from the current data. The rejected recalculation is unchanged."
msgstr "En ny forhåndsvisning er oprettet ud fra de aktuelle data. Den afviste genberegning er uændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:91
msgid "The approved adjustments were executed. They count in the balances and are settled by each creator's next settlement document."
msgstr "De godkendte reguleringer er udført. De indgår i saldiene og afregnes på hver creators næste afregningsbilag."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:92
msgid "The recalculation was closed."
msgstr "Genberegningen er afsluttet."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:93
msgid "The export was created and stored. Earlier exports are kept unchanged."
msgstr "Eksporten er oprettet og gemt. Tidligere eksporter bevares uændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:94
msgid "No export was created: choose a valid group or enter a creator ID."
msgstr "Der er ikke oprettet nogen eksport: vælg en gyldig gruppe, eller indtast et creator-ID."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:96
msgid "Nothing was done: tick the confirmation first."
msgstr "Intet er gjort: sæt først flueben i bekræftelsen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:97
msgid "Another recalculation is still open. Reject or close it first."
msgstr "En anden genberegning er stadig åben. Afvis eller afslut den først."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:98
msgid "Nothing was done: new recalculations are disabled (ADR-064)."
msgstr "Intet blev gjort: nye genberegninger er spærret (ADR-064)."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:99
msgid "Nothing was done: the data changed after the preview or approval (amounts, rows, documents or groups). Reject this recalculation and create a new preview."
msgstr "Intet er gjort: data er ændret efter forhåndsvisningen eller godkendelsen (beløb, rækker, bilag eller grupper). Afvis denne genberegning, og opret en ny forhåndsvisning."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:100
msgid "This step does not fit the recalculation's status; nothing was changed."
msgstr "Dette trin passer ikke til genberegningens status; intet er ændret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:101
msgid "An item could not be executed and was marked as failed; the execution stopped. Items executed before it are kept. Check the cause, then execute again or close the recalculation with a note."
msgstr "En post kunne ikke udføres og er markeret som fejlet; udførelsen er stoppet. Poster, der blev udført før den, bevares. Undersøg årsagen, og udfør derefter igen, eller afslut genberegningen med en note."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:102
msgid "Nothing was done: enter a note of at most 500 characters."
msgstr "Intet er gjort: skriv en note på højst 500 tegn."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:103
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:201
msgid "The recalculation does not exist."
msgstr "Genberegningen findes ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:104
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:178
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til dette."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:105
msgid "Another step is running. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "Et andet trin er i gang. Prøv igen om et øjeblik."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:128
msgid "Settled payouts of creators who were not VAT registered are recalculated without the 20 % deduction (ADR-063). Only the deduction is removed; every other value stays as the settlement document stored it. Each step is separate: preview, approve or reject, execute, close."
msgstr "Afregnede udbetalinger til creators, der ikke var momsregistrerede, genberegnes uden 20 %-fradraget (ADR-063). Kun fradraget fjernes; alle andre værdier står, som afregningsbilaget gemte dem. Hvert trin er særskilt: forhåndsvis, godkend eller afvis, udfør, afslut."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:129
msgid "Executing adds the approved differences to the creators' balances; they appear on each creator's next settlement document. A negative difference is offset against what is available, and the rest is carried forward as outstanding. The legal right to offset has not been validated. Former creators are only reported: nothing is paid or offset for them automatically. Settlement documents and payouts are never changed."
msgstr "Udførelsen lægger de godkendte forskelle til creatornes saldi; de vises på hver creators næste afregningsbilag. En negativ forskel modregnes i det disponible beløb, og resten overføres som udestående. Den juridiske ret til modregning er ikke valideret. Tidligere creators rapporteres kun: der udbetales eller modregnes intet automatisk for dem. Afregningsbilag og udbetalinger ændres aldrig."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:145
msgid "The recalculations could not be read. Please try again later."
msgstr "Genberegningerne kunne ikke læses. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:159
msgid "New recalculations are disabled (ADR-064): the VAT is deducted again from the payout of sales while the creator was not VAT registered, so the deduction is no longer removed. Existing recalculations, their adjustments, exports and history are kept, and their remaining steps can still be completed."
msgstr "Nye genberegninger er spærret (ADR-064): momsen trækkes igen fra udbetalingen for salg, hvor creatoren ikke var momsregistreret, så fradraget fjernes ikke længere. Eksisterende genberegninger, deres reguleringer, eksporter og historik bevares, og deres resterende trin kan stadig gennemføres."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:166
msgid "No recalculations yet."
msgstr "Ingen genberegninger endnu."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:172
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:214
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:495
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "Afsluttet"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:198
msgid "← All recalculations"
msgstr "← Alle genberegninger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:209
msgid "Calculation"
msgstr "Beregning"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:211
msgid "Reopens"
msgstr "Genåbner"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:213
