#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:309
msgid "Check an export: put all five files in one folder. Linux and Git Bash: sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS. macOS: shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS. Windows PowerShell: Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 <file> and compare with the line of the file in SHA256SUMS."
msgstr "Kontrollér en eksport: læg alle fem filer i én mappe. Linux og Git Bash: sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS. macOS: shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS. Windows PowerShell: Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 <fil>, og sammenlign med filens linje i SHA256SUMS."

