msgstr "Salg og udbetalinger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:66
msgid "Saved. Available payout amounts are calculated with the new value from now on."
msgstr "Gemt. Disponible udbetalingsbeløb beregnes med den nye værdi fra nu af."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:68
msgid "You are not allowed to manage payouts."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at administrere udbetalinger."

#. translators: %d: maximum number of days.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:73
#, php-format
msgid "Not saved: enter a whole number of days between 0 and %d."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: indtast et helt antal dage mellem 0 og %d."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:78
msgid "Not saved: enter a valid date that is not in the future, or leave the field empty for the whole history."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: indtast en gyldig dato, der ikke ligger i fremtiden, eller lad feltet være tomt for hele historikken."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:79
msgid "Not saved: the creator already has a settlement document, so the settlement start can no longer be changed."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: creatoren har allerede et afregningsbilag, så afregningsstarten kan ikke længere ændres."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:80
msgid "Not saved: a payout of this creator is being processed. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: en udbetaling for denne creator behandles lige nu. Prøv igen om et øjeblik."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:81
msgid "Not saved: choose one of the listed gift card plugins, or none."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: vælg et af de viste gavekortplugins eller ingen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:82
msgid "Not saved: a CVR or SE number has eight digits. Leave the field empty when there is none."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: et CVR- eller SE-nummer har otte cifre. Lad feltet være tomt, når der ikke er et."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:83
msgid "Not saved: a field is too long or contains line breaks or other control characters."
msgstr "Ikke gemt: et felt er for langt eller indeholder linjeskift eller andre kontroltegn."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:109
msgid "Holding period (days)"
msgstr "Karensperiode (dage)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:116
msgid "A sale counts towards the available payout amount when it is older than this. Refunds and other negative amounts count at once. Changing it changes no sales history."
msgstr "Et salg tæller med i det disponible udbetalingsbeløb, når det er ældre end dette. Refunderinger og andre negative beløb tæller med det samme. En ændring ændrer ingen salgshistorik."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:118
msgid "Save holding period"
msgstr "Gem karensperiode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:134
msgid "CVR number on settlement documents"
msgstr "CVR-nummer på afregningsbilag"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:140
msgid "The CVR number of the business that issues the settlement documents. New documents show it with the shop's name and WooCommerce address; issued documents keep what they were issued with. Leave it empty when it is not registered: the document then says so."
msgstr "CVR-nummeret på den virksomhed, der udsteder afregningsbilagene. Nye bilag viser det sammen med butikkens navn og WooCommerce-adresse; udstedte bilag beholder det, de blev udstedt med. Lad feltet være tomt, når det ikke er registreret: bilaget angiver det så."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:143
msgid "Not registered: new settlement documents show the CVR number as not registered."
msgstr "Ikke registreret: nye afregningsbilag viser CVR-nummeret som ikke registreret."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:147
msgid "Save CVR number"
msgstr "Gem CVR-nummer"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:160
msgid "Payout gift cards"
msgstr "Payout-gavekort"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:161
msgid "Creators can choose a gift card as payout only when a gift card plugin is chosen here and available. You create each card by hand in that plugin and register it on the payout. Bank transfer and PayPal do not depend on this."
msgstr "Creators kan kun vælge et gavekort som udbetaling, når et gavekortplugin er valgt her og er tilgængeligt. Du opretter hvert kort manuelt i pluginet og registrerer det på udbetalingen. Bankoverførsel og PayPal afhænger ikke af dette."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:166
msgid "Status: available."
msgstr "Status: tilgængelig."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:167
msgid "Status: the chosen gift card plugin is not supported. Gift cards are not available."
msgstr "Status: det valgte gavekortplugin understøttes ikke. Gavekort er ikke tilgængelige."

#. translators: %s: reason code, e.g. inactive.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:170
#, php-format
msgid "Status: not available (%s). Gift cards cannot be requested or registered."
msgstr "Status: ikke tilgængelig (%s). Gavekort kan ikke anmodes om eller registreres."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:181
msgid "Gift card plugin"
msgstr "Gavekortplugin"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:183
msgid "None (gift cards off)"
msgstr "Intet (gavekort slået fra)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:190
msgid "Save gift card plugin"
msgstr "Gem gavekortplugin"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:204
msgid "Payout settlement start"
msgstr "Afregningsstart for udbetalinger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:210
msgid "The settlement start could not be read."
msgstr "Afregningsstarten kunne ikke læses."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:215
msgid "Only sales on or after this date count towards the creator's payouts; refunds and corrections follow their sale. Leave it empty to count the whole history. Older sales are never changed or filled in."
msgstr "Kun salg på eller efter denne dato tæller med i creatorens udbetalinger; refunderinger og rettelser følger deres salg. Lad feltet være tomt for at tælle hele historikken. Ældre salg ændres eller udfyldes aldrig."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:221
msgid "Settlement start"
msgstr "Afregningsstart"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:228
msgid "Save settlement start"
msgstr "Gem afregningsstart"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:241
msgid "Master data for settlement documents"
msgstr "Stamdata til afregningsbilag"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:247
msgid "The master data could not be read."
msgstr "Stamdata kunne ikke læses."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:252
msgid "Shown on new settlement documents of this creator; issued documents keep what they were issued with. Fields that are left empty are shown as not registered. Without a legal name, the display name is used."
msgstr "Vises på nye afregningsbilag for denne creator; udstedte bilag beholder det, de blev udstedt med. Tomme felter vises som ikke registreret. Uden et juridisk navn bruges visningsnavnet."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:256
msgid "legal name"
msgstr "juridisk navn"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:257
msgid "address"
msgstr "adresse"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutSettingsSections.php:258
