msgstr "Udsted et rettelsesbilag"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:819
msgid "This settlement document already has 100 correction documents, the most one document can have."
msgstr "Dette afregningsbilag har allerede 100 rettelsesbilag, som er det højeste antal for ét bilag."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:828
msgid "This settlement document cannot be corrected here: its amounts cannot be read."
msgstr "Dette afregningsbilag kan ikke rettes her: dets beløb kan ikke læses."

#. translators: %s: number of the document that is corrected.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:844
#, php-format
msgid "Only for an error you have assessed as material. The correction document corrects %s, the latest document of this payout."
msgstr "Kun til en fejl, du har vurderet som væsentlig. Rettelsesbilaget retter %s, det seneste bilag for denne udbetaling."

#. translators: %s: number of the document that is corrected.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:844
msgid "It refers to the original, states the amounts before and after the correction, the difference and the reason, and shows the parties as registered now. It changes neither the original document, earlier correction documents, the completed payout nor the balance, and the difference is not settled automatically. The VAT is calculated from the corrected commission with VAT at the rate of the document."
msgstr "Det henviser til originalen, angiver beløbene før og efter rettelsen, forskellen og begrundelsen og viser parterne, som de er registreret nu. Det ændrer hverken originalbilaget, tidligere rettelsesbilag, den gennemførte udbetaling eller saldoen, og forskellen afregnes ikke automatisk. Momsen beregnes af den korrigerede kommission med moms til bilagets sats."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:853
msgid "Corrected commission of sales with VAT, incl. VAT"
msgstr "Korrigeret kommission af salg med moms, inkl. moms"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:858
msgid "Corrected commission of sales without VAT"
msgstr "Korrigeret kommission af salg uden moms"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:862
msgid "Filled in with the amounts in force. Only the VAT categories of the sales the original settled are offered, by the creator's VAT status at each sale: no VAT is ever added to the commission of sales while the creator was not VAT registered, or removed from sales while registered. In a document with both, the division between them is your responsibility. A wrong historical VAT status is not corrected here."
msgstr "Udfyldt med de gældende beløb. Kun momskategorierne for de salg, originalen afregnede, tilbydes efter creatorens momsstatus ved hvert salg: der lægges aldrig moms på kommissionen af salg, mens creatoren ikke var momsregistreret, og den fjernes aldrig fra salg, mens creatoren var. I et bilag med begge er fordelingen mellem dem dit ansvar. En forkert historisk momsstatus rettes ikke her."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:865
msgid "Shown on the correction document and to the creator."
msgstr "Vises på rettelsesbilaget og for creatoren."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:867
msgid "I have assessed the error as material, so it requires a separate correction document."
msgstr "Jeg har vurderet fejlen som væsentlig, så den kræver et særskilt rettelsesbilag."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:868
msgid "Issue correction document"
msgstr "Udsted rettelsesbilag"

