#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "The alert API is switched off by the shop. Your keys are kept, but bots get no alerts until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Alert-API'en er slået fra af shoppen. Dine nøgler bevares, men bots får ingen alerts, før den slås til igen."

#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "The shop has not given you access to API keys. Your keys are kept, but bots get no alerts. You can still revoke them."
msgstr "Shoppen har ikke givet dig adgang til API-nøgler. Dine nøgler bevares, men bots får ingen alerts. Du kan stadig tilbagekalde dem."

#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "With an API key, your own bot (for example on Discord or Twitch) can fetch your purchase alerts. Keep the key secret: anyone with it can read your alerts. Revoke a key you no longer use or that others may have seen."
msgstr "Med en API-nøgle kan din egen bot (fx på Discord eller Twitch) hente dine købs-alerts. Hold nøglen hemmelig: alle, der har den, kan læse dine alerts. Tilbagekald en nøgle, du ikke længere bruger, eller som andre kan have set."

#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "Save the key now. It is shown only this once."
msgstr "Gem nøglen nu. Den vises kun denne ene gang."

#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "Your new key"
msgstr "Din nye nøgle"

#: build/dashboard.js:4
msgid "Key copied."
msgstr "Nøglen er kopieret."

